  "title": "Mainframe modernisation with an event-driven bridge to AWS",
  "description": "The IBM Z system keeps CICS and Db2 as the system of record; change data capture streams Db2 changes into MSK, IBM MQ bridges transactions to Lambda through an ESB, and managed file transfer moves nightly batch files to S3 over Direct Connect; on AWS, Mainframe Modernization runs refactored COBOL next to Aurora and an API Gateway that serves the mobile channel.",
